### When to Include Webhook Analysis

Include webhook analysis in your report when:
- The app has **active webhook subscriptions** (check first with subscription query)
- **Monthly webhook volume > 10,000** deliveries (indicates meaningful usage)
- The API category being analyzed typically relies on **real-time data** (e.g., fraud detection, inventory management, order processing)
- Webhook topics directly relate to the **API category** being investigated

**Common webhook patterns by app type:**
- **Fraud Detection**: orders/create, orders/fulfilled, orders/cancelled, disputes/create, refunds/create
- **Inventory Management**: orders/create, orders/fulfilled, fulfillments/update
- **Marketing/Email**: customers/create, orders/create, orders/fulfilled  
- **Returns/Exchange**: orders/fulfilled, refunds/create, returns/create
- **Shipping/Logistics**: fulfillments/create, fulfillments/update, orders/fulfilled